	(descr "Adafruit 12V bias voltage boost converter breakout, TPS61040 (product 5644, https://www.adafruit.com/product/5644), on a 1x04 2.54 mm header: pins 1 G, 2 12V, 3 In, 4 En, as on its silkscreen. The 10.16 x 15.24 mm board lies over this one on the header (2.54 mm spacer), its body to the +x side; its 2.5 mm mounting hole is on Dwgs.User. Dimensions from Adafruit's Eagle board file (github.com/adafruit/Adafruit-TPS61040-PCB). 3D: Adafruit's model (Adafruit_CAD_Parts, MIT) on KiCad's PinHeader_1x04 model")
